%p="Hello #{@user.name}!"

%p Someone (hopefully you) tried to sign up for AntCat with this email address, but it already has an account.

%p
  =link_to 'Log in', @login_url
  with your existing account, or
  =link_to 'reset your password', @forgot_password_url
  if you have forgotten it.

%p If this was not you, please ignore this email. Your account has not been changed.
